## Track 1: Northeast Corner Cancels the Bass

**Story & Context:** At 120 BPM, Leonor establishes a Quadrant Map where SOUTHWEST authorizes the kick reinforcement, SOUTHEAST releases one short bass note, NORTHWEST triggers a prepared-clavichord dyad, and NORTHEAST cancels the next electronic event. Mara programs a rigid two-bar EBM figure, but every NORTHEAST strike deletes whatever would have happened next. The first hook occurs when three rapid corner hits erase bass, clap, and hat in succession, leaving only the adufe and its Rattle Residue. Tomás enters after a 5:1 Edge Census with one dry open-fifth clavichord dyad. Anouk plays a low recorder fundamental during the resulting bass vacancy.

